{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "服务关了",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 42.88,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月，一个以太坊热钱包出了事。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月，一个以太坊热钱包出了事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 1.694,
   "speechEnd": 4.876
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "攻击者控制了 Binance 的内部签名服务。",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制了 Binance 的内部签名服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 5.26,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 5.26,
   "speechEnd": 7.981
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "他通过这个服务，给热钱包设置了一份 EIP-7702 委托。",
   "spoken": "他通过这个服务，给热钱包设置了一份 EIP-7702 委托。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 8.44,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 8.44,
   "speechEnd": 14.015
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "委托的目标，是攻击者自己的合约。",
   "spoken": "委托的目标，是攻击者自己的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 14.42,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 14.42,
   "speechEnd": 17.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "随后，Binance 关闭了提现服务。",
   "spoken": "随后，Binance 关闭了提现服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 17.84,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 17.84,
   "speechEnd": 20.505
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 20.94,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 20.94,
   "speechEnd": 21.741
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "服务关了，这份委托会自动失效吗？",
   "spoken": "服务关了，这份委托会自动失效吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 22.2,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 22.2,
   "speechEnd": 25.686
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "先记住这个问题。",
   "spoken": "先记住这个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 26.38,
   "dur": 1.2,
   "speechStart": 26.38,
   "speechEnd": 27.371
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "在旧的模型里，签名的意思是，转这笔钱。",
   "spoken": "在旧的模型里，签名的意思是，转这笔钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 27.8,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 27.8,
   "speechEnd": 31.536
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "现在，签名的意思变成，允许这段代码替我做事。",
   "spoken": "现在，签名的意思变成，允许这段代码替我做事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 31.94,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 31.94,
   "speechEnd": 36.594
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "签名的含义变大，签错一次的后果，也跟着变大。",
   "spoken": "签名的含义变大，签错一次的后果，也跟着变大。",
